			bark("Orlok is the bartender at the tavern. Though his stories are rather long on time and short on truth, they are quite entertaining. And, better yet, he fills his tankards to the top. However, watch how many you have. If you cause too much trouble, you might get thrown out -- if not by Jenna, then by me. ");
