		{
			bark("Indeed, you are a stranger not to know of the despicable Zealans. They are, or -were-, an insane collection of people who were too blind to recognize the power of the Titans. They foolishly and tenaciously held on to an archaic set of beliefs, and when the Titans demonstrated their might and authority, the Zealans refused to acknowledge the truth. ");
			zealanHis = 1;
			local_m10 -= <<"Zealans? ">>;
			local_m10 = <<"What about the cemetery? ">>;
