		{
			bark("They call themselves Theurgists -- whatever -that- means. All I know is that they provide a valuable service to us here in the city, so I care not how it is done. I am grateful they do not require that we head to their home, Argentrock Isle, for such help. I consider it only too kind that the healers are willing to travel here. ");
			local_m10 -= <<"Describe the healers. ">>;
			local_m10 ^= <<"How do the Theurgists arrive? ">>;
		}
		case "How do the Theurgists arrive? "
