			bark("Ah, the black ones, followers of the Lord of Flame. The Necromancers may deal with death, but oft times I wonder whether the followers of Pyros are not the true representatives of evil. I do know this: Ask not too many questions of the Town Sorcerer, Beren, for our peace with him is tenuous at best. ");
